				"synopsis": {
					"type": "LSString",
					"value": "Raphael (RJTP companion) meets the party at the House of Hope portal and offers to travel with them. One of five roots plays, chosen by the Object flag Osiris sets on the companion before the start. Every outcome sets an RJTP_Event_* flag; Osiris acts on DialogEnded (Return acts on FlagSet)."
				}
